global                                           global-V11-03-08
------
- G4VSIntegration: added new utility class for integration of probability
  density function and dynamically sampling of final state. This is useful
  for the case when sampling tables  cannot be prepared and stored, instead
  computations are performed for each case again and again. 
- G4QuickRand: Added a possibility to set a seed.
- In G4ThreadLocalSingleton, removed unprotected left-over debug inclusion   (o)
  of G4BackTrace header. Addressing problem report #2649.
- Updated date and tag-ID for geant4-11-03-ref-03.

interfaces                                       interfaces-V11-03-03
----------
- G4UIQt: introduced Time Window tab. This exploits generic time windowing
  recently introduced in visualisation.
  Hit "Prepare", then "Go", with, say, 100 events.
  Currently, it doesn't work with OGL in Qt6.
  TSG works fine with both Qt5 and Qt6, except line width is not implemented.

physics_lists
-------------
- lists (phys-list-V11-03-01)
  o G4PhysListFactory: prevent fallback to default physics list when an
    invalid name is provided. Now, if a user specifies an unknown physics
    list, Geant4 will throw a fatal error instead of silently using FTFP_BERT.
    This ensures that users are aware of incorrect configurations and helps
    preventing unintended simulation results.

