  o Updated raw for loops with range-for where possible.
- OpenInventor (openinventor-V11-03-02)
  o G4OpenInventorViewer: implemented CompareForTransientsRedraw().
    Take advantage of ProcessTransients(), which reconstructs that part of
    the graphical database for transient objects, e.g., trajectories,
    without reconstructing the "permanent" (run-duration) objects, e.g.,
    the detector. In other words, something short of a complete "kernel
    visit". For example, if the time window changes. Maximises the efficiency
    of the recently implemented "generic" time windowing.
